an></li></ul></div>\n      \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sv-tabpanel\" data-tabs>\n      <div class=\"sv-tabpanel__list pill-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Two numbers decide everything\">\n        <button class=\"tabs__tab\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-business-continuity-disaster-recovery-services-2-0\" aria-controls=\"panel-business-continuity-disaster-recovery-services-2-0\" aria-selected=\"true\">{{s10}}</button><button class=\"tabs__tab\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-business-continuity-disaster-recovery-services-2-1\" aria-controls=\"panel-business-continuity-disaster-recovery-services-2-1\" aria-selected=\"false\">{{s11}}</button><button class=\"tabs__tab\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-business-continuity-disaster-recovery-services-2-2\" aria-controls=\"panel-business-continuity-disaster-recovery-services-2-2\" aria-selected=\"false\">{{s12}}</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tabs__panel sv-tabpanel__panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"panel-business-continuity-disaster-recovery-services-2-0\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-business-continuity-disaster-recovery-services-2-0\" tabindex=\"0\"><p class=\"sv-tabpanel__n\">{{s13}}</p><p>{{s14}}</p></div><div class=\"tabs__panel sv-tabpanel__panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"panel-business-continuity-disaster-recovery-services-2-1\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-business-continuity-disaster-recovery-services-2-1\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden><p class=\"sv-tabpanel__n\">{{s15}}</p><p>{{s16}}</p></div><div class=\"tabs__panel sv-tabpanel__panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"panel-business-continuity-disaster-recovery-services-2-2\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-business-continuity-disaster-recovery-services-2-2\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden><p class=\"sv-tabpanel__n\">{{s17}}</p><p>{{s18}}</p></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>","uses":1,"slots":[{"k":"s0","type":"s","label":"Label above heading 1","default":"The two numbers"},{"k":"s1","type":"s","label":"Heading 1","default":"Two numbers decide everything"},{"k":"s2","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 1","default":"Before any of the technology matters, two questions need answering, and they are business questions rather than IT ones."},{"k":"s3","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 2","default":"What we agree with you"},{"k":"s4","type":"s","label":"List item 1","default":"Recovery point objective, per system"},{"k":"s5","type":"s","label":"List item 2","default":"Recovery time objective, per system"},{"k":"s6","type":"s","label":"List item 3","default":"What is genuinely critical and what can wait"},{"k":"s7","type":"s","label":"List item 4","default":"Who does what during an incident"},{"k":"s8","type":"s","label":"List item 5","default":"How often recovery is tested"},{"k":"s9","type":"s","label":"List item 6","default":"Where the documentation lives when systems are down"},{"k":"s10","type":"s","label":"Button 1","default":"RPO: work you can lose"},{"k":"s11","type":"s","label":"Button 2","default":"RTO: time you can be down"},{"k":"s12","type":"s","label":"Button 3","default":"Why both come first"},{"k":"s13","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 3","default":"01 / 03"},{"k":"s14","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 4","default":"How much work can you afford to lose? That is your recovery point objective. If backups run nightly, your RPO is up to 24 hours, which means a failure at four in the afternoon costs you the whole day. For a finance team mid month that might be genuinely serious. For other work it is an annoyance. Only you can say which."},{"k":"s15","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 5","default":"02 / 03"},{"k":"s16","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 6","default":"How long can you be down? That is your recovery time objective. Restoring a large fileserver from cloud storage is not quick, and if the honest answer is two days while the business needs four hours, no amount of backup software fixes that. The design has to change instead, usually towards replication or standby systems for the handful of things that genuinely cannot wait."},{"k":"s17","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 7","default":"03 / 03"},{"k":"s18","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 8","default":"Get those two numbers agreed and everything else follows from them. Skip them and you end up with backups that technically exist and a recovery that takes a week, which is the situation most businesses are quietly in."}]}